    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizruntimedoc-List Pharmacy Prescriptions Historys-v2-spec",
    "description": "The Pharmacy Prescriptions History API provides access to the prescription history for patients within a pharmacy setting. This endpoint allows authorized clients to retrieve detailed records of past prescriptions, including medication details, dispensing dates, and pharmacy information. It is typically utilized by healthcare providers, pharmacists, and healthcare applications that need to track patient medication histories. By leveraging this API, stakeholders can improve medication adherence and enhance patient care through better visibility into past prescriptions.",
